{"id":"aca515b20bf2fbd3","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["92-thm-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-truth-predicate]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82bf7f23ed43df1\" href=\"?note=b82bf7f23ed43df1\" title=\"92-df-truth-predicate\">92-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (candidate truth formula and distinguished variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G\\)</span> (full truth-definition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b82bf7f23ed43df1\" href=\"?note=b82bf7f23ed43df1\" title=\"92-df-truth-predicate\">92-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\\)</span>已在<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b82bf7f23ed43df1\" href=\"?note=b82bf7f23ed43df1\" title=\"92-df-truth-predicate\">92-df-truth-predicate</a>中用无捕获代入和外部算术真理精确定义，避免把公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>误写成可直接应用于数码的元层函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> : 句子</li>\n<li>Tarski定理是关于标准算术真在标准模型中的不可定义性，不以某个证明系统的相容性为定义</li>\n<li>通过Liar悖论构造：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>定义真，对角构造给出与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x)\\)</span>同真值的句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，从而导致矛盾</li>\n<li>与Gödel不完备性定理密切相关</li>\n<li>结论针对完整算术真理；固定复杂度层的部分真谓词仍可在算术中定义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G$ (full truth-definition predicate, see [[92-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)$已在[[92-df-truth-predicate]]中用无捕获代入和外部算术真理精确定义，避免把公式$T$误写成可直接应用于数码的元层函数","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x)","display":false},